&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;166人&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;（32.4％）&lt;/p&gt;
